{"video_id":"Q9ycQHbDdJs","title":"Agents Need Receipts, Not More Tool Calls - Armanas Povilionis, Alithea Bio","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":972,"segments":[{"start":1.52,"duration":6.84,"text":"What is the most valuable agentic"},{"start":5.4,"duration":2.96,"text":"automation work?"},{"start":10.16,"duration":6.8,"text":"I think scientific research"},{"start":12.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"is quite high on that list."},{"start":17.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"After a decade working in life sciences"},{"start":19.4,"duration":5.84,"text":"collaboration projects,"},{"start":22.24,"duration":6.0,"text":"I think that more tools alone will not"},{"start":25.24,"duration":5.2,"text":"enable automation of scientific"},{"start":28.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"research."},{"start":30.44,"duration":5.6,"text":"Because science work relies on"},{"start":33.68,"duration":6.28,"text":"collaboration."},{"start":36.04,"duration":8.68,"text":"For agents to collaborate autonomously,"},{"start":39.96,"duration":4.76,"text":"we need a chain of verifiable receipts."},{"start":45.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"We need a solution which can provide"},{"start":47.56,"duration":4.8,"text":"these receipts proving every step,"},{"start":50.28,"duration":5.0,"text":"ensuring that every result can be"},{"start":52.36,"duration":5.36,"text":"trusted, and enabling collaboration at"},{"start":55.28,"duration":2.44,"text":"scale."},{"start":58.72,"duration":3.48,"text":"Let's step back."},{"start":60.2,"duration":6.68,"text":"Imagine an"},{"start":62.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"Imagine agents as cooks in the kitchen."},{"start":66.96,"duration":4.96,"text":"Giving them more tools improves"},{"start":69.16,"duration":6.08,"text":"kitchen's efficiency."},{"start":71.92,"duration":6.52,"text":"Better knives, more pans, more ovens"},{"start":75.24,"duration":8.56,"text":"boost the speed and quality."},{"start":78.44,"duration":5.36,"text":"But it only enhances local work."},{"start":84.32,"duration":3.12,"text":"Scientific work"},{"start":86.0,"duration":4.12,"text":"is"},{"start":87.44,"duration":5.64,"text":"not cooking alone in your own kitchen."},{"start":90.12,"duration":4.52,"text":"It is closer to running a Michelin star"},{"start":93.08,"duration":4.92,"text":"restaurant."},{"start":94.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"The outcomes depend on suppliers and"},{"start":98.0,"duration":3.92,"text":"their produce,"},{"start":100.16,"duration":3.48,"text":"the level of service that you can"},{"start":101.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"provide,"},{"start":103.64,"duration":6.6,"text":"and an ability to consistently deliver"},{"start":106.64,"duration":6.04,"text":"the same quality dish again and again"},{"start":110.24,"duration":2.44,"text":"and again."},{"start":113.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"You can cannot bring everything into one"},{"start":117.0,"duration":5.32,"text":"kitchen."},{"start":118.36,"duration":8.8,"text":"The challenge isn't local tools."},{"start":122.32,"duration":4.84,"text":"It is aligning the entire supply chain."},{"start":127.52,"duration":3.76,"text":"Today we already have plenty of tools"},{"start":130.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"for"},{"start":131.28,"duration":6.72,"text":"agents and agent automation."},{"start":134.4,"duration":6.68,"text":"On other hand, we also have data and"},{"start":138.0,"duration":4.88,"text":"specialized analytics algorithms,"},{"start":141.08,"duration":6.56,"text":"which are distributed across"},{"start":142.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"organizations and and and live in silos."},{"start":148.24,"duration":8.0,"text":"At Alifeia, our vision for Froglet"},{"start":152.64,"duration":3.6,"text":"is very simple."},{"start":156.8,"duration":5.76,"text":"As agentic workflow automation matures,"},{"start":160.48,"duration":5.6,"text":"organizations will"},{"start":162.56,"duration":7.44,"text":"not just give agents more tools,"},{"start":166.08,"duration":6.6,"text":"they will allocate them budgets."},{"start":170.0,"duration":4.36,"text":"We already kind of doing it in a"},{"start":172.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"primitive way,"},{"start":174.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"allocating them token budgets"},{"start":177.68,"duration":5.72,"text":"per task."},{"start":180.24,"duration":5.92,"text":"The next step is a bit broader."},{"start":183.4,"duration":4.28,"text":"It's allowing agents to manage their own"},{"start":186.16,"duration":2.92,"text":"budget"},{"start":187.68,"duration":2.88,"text":"for"},{"start":189.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"anything that they might need,"},{"start":190.56,"duration":6.96,"text":"discovering services, requesting data,"},{"start":194.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"negotiating execution,"},{"start":197.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"paying for work"},{"start":199.48,"duration":5.2,"text":"in cross-organizational"},{"start":201.8,"duration":2.88,"text":"boundary setting."},{"start":206.0,"duration":5.24,"text":"At that point, the agent is no longer"},{"start":208.32,"duration":7.04,"text":"just a cook with a better knife."},{"start":211.24,"duration":6.08,"text":"It starts acting like an executive chef,"},{"start":215.36,"duration":4.84,"text":"finding suppliers,"},{"start":217.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"ordering ingredients,"},{"start":220.2,"duration":4.52,"text":"coordinating kitchen"},{"start":222.4,"duration":4.24,"text":"the kitchen work,"},{"start":224.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"and keeping a record of everything"},{"start":226.64,"duration":6.16,"text":"what's happening."},{"start":229.36,"duration":6.6,"text":"That is why we're building Froglet."},{"start":232.8,"duration":6.04,"text":"The protocol for a agents to discover,"},{"start":235.96,"duration":4.4,"text":"transact with, and receive verifiable"},{"start":238.84,"duration":4.88,"text":"receipts"},{"start":240.36,"duration":6.84,"text":"for external data and services"},{"start":243.72,"duration":3.48,"text":"and service providers."},{"start":247.68,"duration":5.76,"text":"Froglet is designed to sit in between of"},{"start":251.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"many moving parts."},{"start":253.44,"duration":5.0,"text":"And that's why we are not replacing"},{"start":255.88,"duration":5.72,"text":"existing tools and protocols."},{"start":258.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"We integrate with different payment"},{"start":261.6,"duration":4.44,"text":"rails,"},{"start":262.72,"duration":6.24,"text":"with different agent and harnesses,"},{"start":266.04,"duration":6.4,"text":"execution environments, and even"},{"start":268.96,"duration":6.56,"text":"network transport protocols."},{"start":272.44,"duration":5.44,"text":"It does not require that everyone has"},{"start":275.52,"duration":4.32,"text":"the same software stack."},{"start":277.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"It just requires that everyone has the"},{"start":279.84,"duration":3.0,"text":"same interface."},{"start":283.44,"duration":4.52,"text":"For more details, please visit"},{"start":284.96,"duration":3.0,"text":"froglet.dev."},{"start":289.0,"duration":5.32,"text":"Where you will be able to run to see how"},{"start":291.88,"duration":5.08,"text":"to run Froglet locally with just one"},{"start":294.32,"duration":2.64,"text":"command."},{"start":297.04,"duration":6.08,"text":"Or you can even try Froglet remotely"},{"start":299.84,"duration":3.28,"text":"with just one prompt."},{"start":305.88,"duration":4.2,"text":"So, in essence,"},{"start":307.56,"duration":7.6,"text":"close scientific collaboration often"},{"start":310.08,"duration":5.08,"text":"turns into a bespoke enterprise project."},{"start":315.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"That can take years and cost millions"},{"start":318.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"before even first reusable"},{"start":321.08,"duration":6.28,"text":"workflow exists."},{"start":324.24,"duration":7.48,"text":"On the other hand, the Froglet's mission"},{"start":327.36,"duration":4.36,"text":"is to simplify that much more."},{"start":332.8,"duration":4.68,"text":"Once your organization has deemed that"},{"start":334.64,"duration":5.88,"text":"the resource is shareable,"},{"start":337.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"a provider should be able"},{"start":340.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"to"},{"start":341.72,"duration":5.76,"text":"expose it for Froglet."},{"start":344.88,"duration":6.12,"text":"An agent can discover it,"},{"start":347.48,"duration":7.44,"text":"understand its terms, request the work,"},{"start":351.0,"duration":6.76,"text":"and receive verifiable receipt."},{"start":354.92,"duration":5.4,"text":"That costs few thousand tokens and takes"},{"start":357.76,"duration":2.56,"text":"minutes."},{"start":364.64,"duration":6.84,"text":"Let's deep dive a bit deeper."},{"start":367.72,"duration":6.76,"text":"So, here is our Froglet Dev website, and"},{"start":371.48,"duration":4.4,"text":"here you can see"},{"start":374.48,"duration":4.0,"text":"um"},{"start":375.88,"duration":4.88,"text":"a walkthrough button. If you click on"},{"start":378.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"it, you will have a much more detailed"},{"start":380.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"review of what's happening, and you can"},{"start":382.72,"duration":8.0,"text":"read documentation in even more detail."},{"start":386.84,"duration":8.04,"text":"So, first of all, the Froglet network"},{"start":390.72,"duration":6.92,"text":"consists of homogeneous nodes."},{"start":394.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"Every single actor in the environment"},{"start":397.64,"duration":3.68,"text":"runs the same core"},{"start":400.52,"duration":2.16,"text":"um"},{"start":401.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"node."},{"start":402.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"It just plays a different role. There"},{"start":405.24,"duration":5.0,"text":"are requesters, there are providers,"},{"start":408.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"and there is a marketplace, which is a"},{"start":410.24,"duration":5.4,"text":"just a Froglet running the specialized"},{"start":413.12,"duration":2.52,"text":"service."},{"start":416.56,"duration":6.24,"text":"What it solves is how to find"},{"start":420.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"how for a requester to find the"},{"start":422.8,"duration":4.52,"text":"providers,"},{"start":424.24,"duration":4.76,"text":"how to trust them, how to battle pay or"},{"start":427.32,"duration":4.2,"text":"settle,"},{"start":429.0,"duration":5.08,"text":"and how to prove that execution has"},{"start":431.52,"duration":2.56,"text":"happened."},{"start":436.2,"duration":6.24,"text":"Whenever you're generating a new node,"},{"start":439.84,"duration":6.12,"text":"you're generating a key pair for"},{"start":442.44,"duration":3.52,"text":"identity and signing."},{"start":446.4,"duration":7.76,"text":"And every time you execute anything with"},{"start":449.32,"duration":8.0,"text":"Froglet, it uses your keys to sign"},{"start":454.16,"duration":5.2,"text":"on the chain. And the chain consists of"},{"start":457.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"everything what you do, from descriptors"},{"start":459.36,"duration":5.68,"text":"to offer to quote to deal for invoice"},{"start":462.68,"duration":4.56,"text":"and finally receipt."},{"start":465.04,"duration":5.36,"text":"Therefore, you cannot tamper with any"},{"start":467.24,"duration":7.0,"text":"part of this chain."},{"start":470.4,"duration":3.84,"text":"Otherwise, the chain will be broken."},{"start":477.12,"duration":6.56,"text":"And to discover services, providers of"},{"start":480.36,"duration":5.16,"text":"services, just register and describe"},{"start":483.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"their services to the marketplace."},{"start":485.52,"duration":6.16,"text":"Marketplace itself provides the services"},{"start":488.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"for providing descriptions"},{"start":491.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"and for indexing what's"},{"start":494.52,"duration":3.36,"text":"what is existing what services existing"},{"start":496.28,"duration":5.52,"text":"on the marketplace."},{"start":497.88,"duration":6.16,"text":"Once a requester requests an index of"},{"start":501.8,"duration":5.28,"text":"available services,"},{"start":504.04,"duration":5.76,"text":"from there on, it continues direct"},{"start":507.08,"duration":5.44,"text":"communication with that requester."},{"start":509.8,"duration":5.6,"text":"It doesn't need a middleman."},{"start":512.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"So, the requester and provider"},{"start":515.4,"duration":4.16,"text":"communicates"},{"start":517.0,"duration":5.6,"text":"with each other directly, and it all"},{"start":519.56,"duration":7.88,"text":"happens in one interaction: requests,"},{"start":522.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"signing, execution, and receipt."},{"start":528.04,"duration":5.68,"text":"On a payment side, we have a system"},{"start":530.96,"duration":5.76,"text":"where it where all payments, if it's not"},{"start":533.72,"duration":7.32,"text":"free, has two parts. One is a base"},{"start":536.72,"duration":7.12,"text":"payment, and another is success fee."},{"start":541.04,"duration":6.52,"text":"So, base payment protects the providers"},{"start":543.84,"duration":6.08,"text":"that they wouldn't be attacked by uh"},{"start":547.56,"duration":5.72,"text":"multiple requests."},{"start":549.92,"duration":8.2,"text":"And success fee is providing the"},{"start":553.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"requesters from malicious providers."},{"start":559.44,"duration":5.64,"text":"In essence,"},{"start":561.12,"duration":6.88,"text":"the Froglet [snorts] itself is not an AI"},{"start":565.08,"duration":4.96,"text":"agent, but it is created specifically"},{"start":568.0,"duration":5.32,"text":"for agents"},{"start":570.04,"duration":7.32,"text":"as an interface to find each other."},{"start":573.32,"duration":6.56,"text":"As an interface to find the data and"},{"start":577.36,"duration":6.88,"text":"services cross borders"},{"start":579.88,"duration":7.0,"text":"and execute these deals directly"},{"start":584.24,"duration":2.64,"text":"with each other."},{"start":588.12,"duration":7.0,"text":"So, coming back to recap,"},{"start":592.36,"duration":5.8,"text":"a froglet lets agent to discover"},{"start":595.12,"duration":5.8,"text":"external scientific resources,"},{"start":598.16,"duration":4.6,"text":"execute work across organizational"},{"start":600.92,"duration":4.64,"text":"boundaries,"},{"start":602.76,"duration":6.12,"text":"and it gives every transaction a"},{"start":605.56,"duration":6.2,"text":"verifiable receipt."},{"start":608.88,"duration":6.8,"text":"Together, this opens the door to"},{"start":611.76,"duration":3.92,"text":"autonomous scientific progress."},{"start":616.32,"duration":4.92,"text":"We hope you will join us and enjoyed"},{"start":618.6,"duration":2.64,"text":"this talk."},{"start":621.6,"duration":2.48,"text":"Thank you."}]}